<div class="f8">
<section class="lp-faq">
  <h2>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
  <details><summary>How does the subscription work?</summary><p>Formul8 Nutrition is a monthly subscription. You pay ${{ settings.jar_sale_price }} today for your first jar, then ${{ settings.jar_regular_price }} per month until you cancel. Each delivery is one jar of 30 servings. {{ settings.cancel_text }}: cancel online from your customer account or by contacting us{% if settings.support_email != blank %} at {{ settings.support_email }}{% endif %}.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What is in Formul8 Nutrition?</summary><p>{{ section.settings.a_ingredients }}</p></details>
  <details><summary>How many servings are in a jar?</summary><p>Each jar contains 30 servings.</p></details>
  <details><summary>How do the free gifts work?</summary><p>Your first order includes your first jar and both free gifts, and the gifts show as FREE at checkout. Later monthly deliveries include the jar only.{% if settings.offer_link != blank %} The button on this page adds everything to your cart for you.{% endif %} Gifts are limited by stock.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What is the money-back guarantee?</summary><p>Your purchase is backed by our {{ settings.guarantee_days }}-day money-back guarantee. A refund request does not cancel your subscription: cancel separately from your customer account or by contacting us. {% if shop.refund_policy.url != blank %}See our <a href="{{ shop.refund_policy.url }}">refund policy</a> for how it works.{% else %}Details are in our refund policy.{% endif %}</p></details>
  <details><summary>What about shipping?</summary><p>{{ section.settings.a_shipping }}</p></details>
</section>
</div>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "LP: FAQ",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Questions" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "a_ingredients", "label": "Ingredients answer (UPDATE before publishing)", "default": "Our proposed formula includes prebiotic fiber, L-glutamine, green banana resistant starch, probiotics (being considered) and ginger root extract. Product in development. Ingredients, quantities, flavor, and final product specifications are subject to change. The final Supplement Facts will be shown on the product label and product page." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "a_shipping", "label": "Shipping answer (UPDATE with real terms)", "default": "Shipping options and costs are shown at checkout." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "LP: FAQ" }]
}
{% endschema %}
